dge and validate engagement completion and to unlock incentive funding from Microsoft. Please follow up with your customer to ensure timely submission and payout eligibility.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr kumimoji="0" lang="en-GB" sz="1400" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" kern="1200" cap="none" spc="0" normalizeH="0" baseline="0" noProof="0"><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="323139"/></a:solidFill><a:effectLst/><a:uLnTx/><a:uFillTx/><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/><a:ea typeface="+mn-ea"/><a:cs typeface="+mn-cs"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="Title 1"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{D31797B7-A87F-8EEA-9755-984BA7D70166}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="588264" y="2875002"/><a:ext cx="3640836" cy="1107996"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB"/><a:t>Delivery </a:t></a:r><a:br><a:rPr lang="en-GB"/></a:br><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB"/><a:t>completion</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Text Placeholder 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{915522DD-9213-BFF1-3B9E-7A45A35B1392}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph sz="quarter" idx="10"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="4794250" y="1977193"/><a:ext cx="6565900" cy="1605504"/></a:xfrm></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr vert="horz" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr" anchorCtr="0"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>The </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="+mj-lt"/></a:rPr><a:t>M365 Copilot Deployment Accelerator </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>is typically completed after you conduct an Executive Summary presentation. This presentation should be attended by the business sponsors, IT and key business stakeholders. </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1800"><a:solidFill><a:schemeClr val="accent1"><a:lumMod val="75000"/></a:schemeClr></a:solidFill></a:rPr><a:t>Recommended agenda items include:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Review the scope, goals, and discuss the engagement output.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Present recommendations to the customer, framing the results in terms of strategic alignment and value of the initiatives identified during the engagement.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Identify and review any additional recommendations and next steps.  </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>Gather feedback on how the engagement was delivered.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="2"/><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1400"/><a:t>The Executive Summary presentation as well as any other deliverables you choose can be handed to the customer at the conclusion of the engagement.</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="Picture 10"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{FBC543E7-9258-BE15-C0FB-D4F645C004D4}"/></a:ext><a:ext uri="{C183D7F6-B498-43B3-948B-1728B52AA6E4}"><adec:decorative xmlns:adec="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2017/decorative" val="1"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvPicPr><a:picLo